From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:29:21 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add boot modules and VKB data (devices/google-aurora)

Add the Pixel Watch 2 boot-time module configuration and vendor boot
kernel (VKB) assembly data:

- static module dependency, alias, softdep, and charger load lists
- aurora-specific module load list and post-rootfs configuration
- VKB assembly script and base DTB
- USB extcon shim configuration

These files provide the data consumed by the boot derivation and are
kept separate from the device configuration.
